    "/terms-conditions/": {
      "title": "Terms & Conditions – Piran Trading Limited",
      "metaDesc": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "t": "Terms & Conditions"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Home"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Terms & Conditions"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Piran trading ltd will provide all customers with a written quotation, which will include sufficient detail for the completion of the works. If any clarification is required, please contact us so that we can provide it. Extra works can be provided subject to a written confirmation including cost."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "A ‘contract’ with piran trading ltd is an agreement by the client to have work undertaken based on a written quotation headed ‘Quote/Estimate’ submitted directly to the client on an official piran trading ltd letterhead and is a clear and straightforward undertaking between the two parties to form a contract."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Once a quotation has been accepted (either verbally or in writing) and the client has paid their deposit, then a contract has been entered into and these terms will come into effect. Quotes are valid for 15 days from the date on the quote."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Once the client has entered into a contract with piran trading ltd, by paying their deposit, with in 5 to 10 days cash or bank transfer."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "All prices quoted are calculated on the basis of free access and unimpeded working during our normal working hours (8am – 5pm Mon – Fri). If urgent work for costumer we can do weekend also"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "It is the customer’s responsibility to arrange planning permission, building control. If planning permission is required for the work, piran trading may request to see proof that this has been agreed prior to beginning work."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Commencement of work is under the assumption of uninterrupted work for the duration of the contract and in accordance with planning permission where applicable. Piran trading will not be held liable for any costs incurred as a result of delays due to unforeseen circumstances. (eg planning permission delays resulting in work having to stop)"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Free access is required for delivery of building materials, plant, machinery, skips etc."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Piran trading Ltd will provide a payment plan to the client prior to commencement of works. This will usually include a 5% to 20% deposit because depending on work , staged payments and an end payment upon completion of works. Deposits are non-refundable and allow piran trading to book work in and agree a formal start date for works and purchase materials. Please note: In the very unlikely event that piran trading Ltd have to cancel your work, your deposit will be fully refunded."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Invoices all we can provide for end of the work. Payments must be made in a timely manner or work progress may be impeded or ceased (in the case of non-payment). Payments can be made by cash but bank transfer is our preferred method. All invoices include our bank details for bank transfers."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Insurance – Public Liability and Employers’ Liability: piran trading ltd has Public Liability Insurance and Employers’ Liability to the sum of £1,000,000. All usual general building practices are covered within our insurance policy."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Guarantees: All customers will benefit from a full guarantee on our workmanship for a period of 12 months. Guarantees on materials run in accordance with manufacturer’s warranty periods where applicable. Our guarantee covers all new work and new materials used in construction or repairs, but does not guarantee the integrity of any existing structures, materials or decorations. In the event of a failure beyond the guarantee period we will be happy to investigate the cause and negotiate a solution to the problem without delay and carry out any agreed repairs as soon as possible. Charges may apply for remedial work carried out beyond guarantee dates or to items not covered by our guarantee. Please note: Decorations are signed off on completion and not covered by guarantee. Plastering work is covered by a 6 month guarantee. Please note we provide a 6 month guarantee for plastering work to allow for settling in time. We therefore strongly recommend delaying any decorating for this period."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "We will not be held responsible for the suitability of the existing boilers ability to provide for additional plumbing works. If the existing boiler is found to be unsuitable, this shall be discussed with the client and any parts required shall be supplied at trade cost. If we have to remove existing radiators for any reason (eg plastering) we will not be held responsible for their effectiveness once they are replaced."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "piran trading ltd will endeavour to protect existing surfaces with the use of dustsheets and loose plastic sheeting etc along with care in our working practice. However, responsibility for protection from damage of any existing surface or fabrics etc is the responsibility of the client. Arrangement can be made to put in place protection of existing surfaces, over and above our basic cover, at a negotiated additional cost. We strongly recommend the clients moves any expensive or sentimental items before work commences. If we are required to move furniture to undertake our work we will not be held responsible for any breakages or stains that may occur. We advice clients to keep all valuables and expensive items safe and secure for the duration of the works, as we cannot be held liable for any theft or loss."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Discounts and retentions: Prices are based on the understanding that no retentions are held unless previously arranged and authorised. No Main Contractor or Sub Contractor discounts are given unless agreed and confirmed in writing."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "We will endeavour to employ a helpful attitude at all times and will always attempt to bring the building works to a satisfactory conclusion as soon as possible taking into account weather conditions, availability of specialist materials and unforeseen circumstances etc."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "piran trading ltd take pictures of the progress of our projects. We reserve the right to use these pictures in our portfolio of work, on various social media websites for marketing and information purposes."
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Full name"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Address"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Phone number"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Email address"
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "t": "Date of birth"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "t": "This letter will serve to confirm our agreement regarding your work. Please sign the page return to me. Your confirmation of our agreement please respond to verify that’s all the above informations correct."
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "t": "Date signature"
        }
      ],
      "imgs": [],
      "forms": 0
    },
